，只是放在那里而已。”","career":["seiyu"],"id":5636,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":190878},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg"},"name":"桃乃","summary":"今回ゲーム初参加。\r\nのんびりした性格で、スタイルが良い。\r\n\r\n趣味・特技：飲食店の良し悪しを外見から見抜くこと\r\n苦手なこと：人の嘘を見抜くこと\r\n次回参加見込：GHOST HOUSE","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/48/1f/41365_prsn_F0RRZ.jpg?r=1723864344"},"name":"川口莉奈","short_summary":"青二プロダクション 所属\r\n\r\n出身地：埼玉県\r\n趣味：歌唱、イラスト、MMD、ダンス\r\n特技：紅茶を淹れ方、ドラム、口笛・歯笛","career":["seiyu"],"id":41365,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":190879}],"detail":[{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/0a/29/190879_crt_4EemN.jpg"},"summary":"今回ゲーム初参加。\r\nのんびりした性格で、スタイルが良い。\r\n\r\n趣味・特技：飲食店の良し悪しを外見から見抜くこと\r\n苦手なこと：人の嘘を見抜くこと\r\n次回参加見込：GHOST HOUSE","name":"桃乃","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"桃乃"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"日文名","v":"モモノ"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":1},"id":190879,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/cc/a0/190875_crt_VQ3yg.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/cc/a0/1908